## Example

```json
{
  "node_type": "batch",
  "properties": {
    "mode": "accumulate_all",
    "window_type": "fixed",
    "fixed_window": "1h",
    "batch_key": ".post_id",
    "retain_count": 10,
    "retain_order": "last"
  }
}
```

### Example — relative window (close 30 minutes before a payload timestamp)

```json
{
  "node_type": "batch",
  "properties": {
    "mode": "accumulate_all",
    "window_type": "relative_to",
    "relative_to": {
      "pivot_expr": ".due_at",
      "offset_type": "before",
      "offset_value_type": "fixed",
      "offset_value": "30m"
    }
  }
}
```
